  "sourceText": "Baked Egg Soufflé Recipe\nBy: Rosanne E.\nPublished: Thursday, July 8, 2010 - 1:04pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 Eggs\n1 cup Flour\n1 cup Parmesan Cheese\n2 cups Milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Pour oil into bottom of Pyrex and place in over while preheating @ 425 °. 2 Bake for 20 minutes.  Egg will be popped up and a little brown.",
